Provenance
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The encoder and decoder are original implementations written from ISO/IEC
13818-7 (MPEG-2 AAC) and ISO/IEC 14496-3 (MPEG-4 Audio) and published
literature. They are not translations of, and do not derive from, any other
AAC encoder's or decoder's source. The normative tables (the Huffman
codebooks, the scalefactor band tables, TNS_MAX_BANDS) are reproduced from
ISO/IEC 13818-7:2004; docs/PROVENANCE.md records the copy they were
transcribed from and the owner's approval of it.

The decoder is verified against ffmpeg's decoder, used only as a black box
(a command-line tool whose PCM is compared); none of its code is included
or was consulted. The test streams in tests/data were made by encoders run
the same way, as command-line tools; they are encoder output only.

