Patents
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

AAC may be subject to patent licensing in some jurisdictions; Via LA
administers a licensing programme for AAC. This licence grants no rights
under any patent, and the authors make no claim about whether a licence is
needed for any use. Spectral band replication, parametric stereo and USAC
(HE-AAC, HE-AAC v2, xHE-AAC) are not implemented: an HE-AAC stream decodes
as its AAC-LC core.

